  "color": {
    "$description": "Tier 2, semantic colour roles. Component CSS uses the --surface-* roles (set by .surface-paper / .surface-wood) or these directly, never a primitive. The game UI is wood throughout (body.play carries .surface-wood); paper is the website's (landing, classic).",
