  "text": {
    "$description": "Type scale (rem, so the larger-text setting scales it). Functional text is --text-sm (14 px) or larger. --text-xs (12 px) is only for uppercase labels and glanceable numbers (slot counts); --text-2xs (10 px) only for decorative duplicates (compass letters, slot key numbers).",
